elementor-element-f06fd13\" data-id=\"f06fd13\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-08750c6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"08750c6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>As an ABA practice owner, whether you&#8217;re an established leader, in a growth phase, or just starting out, it is important that your technology adapts to your unique and evolving needs.<\/p><p>Rethink&#8217;s Marketplace is a collection of specialized tools, innovations, and functionality, from a range of trusted providers, that are accessible from within the RethinkBH platform. Clients can install a growing list of Marketplace solutions available for plug-and-play access which results in unparalleled customization of your ABA practice management and clinical workflows.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-db66004 elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"db66004\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Available Integrations &amp; Solutions<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-03aa796 e-grid e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"03aa796\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5ab49e6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5ab49e6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b385b5f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b385b5f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Assessment Software<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bfd31bc elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"bfd31bc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"60\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/autism-analytica-rethinkbh-marketplace-assessment-software.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-20463\" alt=\"Autism Analytica logo\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f15cb2f elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f15cb2f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Streamline clinical workflow and apply evidence-based assessment standards essential to the evaluation, treatment planning, and progress monitoring processes associated with neurodevelopmental disabilities and child mental health.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e419c5a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e419c5a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad80625 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ad80625\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Assessment Software<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cfcdfb0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"cfcdfb0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"60\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/essential-for-living-rethinkbh-integration-solution.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-22612\" alt=\"Essential for Living logo\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8f8e35 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c8f8e35\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>EFL is a function-based assessment and curriculum that continues to work on communication, tolerating, daily living skills, and functional academics while using Rethink\u2019s data collection system.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d1b896e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d1b896e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cf34313 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cf34313\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">CRM Software<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elemento